  "id": "ecological-perspective",
  "term": "ecological perspective",
  "definition": "In this source, an ecological perspective means understanding learning as shaped by interacting cognitive, social, and material elements of the learner’s environment. It looks at how thinking and study approaches, relationships and collaboration, and features of the learning setting together influence students’ experiences.",
